# The Road to Aht Urhgan (jeuno 91): "Where's Tenzen?" from the accepted state's 10064, and its other selections. A
# level 75 Warrior with a fresh char's 1000 gil, accepted by a GM at Prog 1, RoV Inescapable Binds current: 10064 (0, 0,
# 0, 0, 0, 1); finished 1: completed, the Boarding Permit, the mission completed and Desert Winds added. Set accepted
# again at Prog 0 (a GM): 10064 (0, ..., 0) (Desert Winds current now); finished 2: Prog 1; 10064 finished 3 with 1000
# gil: nothing; finished 0: no arm.
lists LowerJeuno/Faursel/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10064
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=39.5,4.1,-45.2 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.TheRoadToAhtUrhgan accepted
mission Rov InescapableBinds current
charvar Quest[3][91]Prog 1
login
trigger Faursel                     # accepted, Prog 1, the mission: 10064 (0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1)
finish option=1                     # completed; the Boarding Permit; the mission completed, Desert Winds added
quest Jeuno.TheRoadToAhtUrhgan available # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheRoadToAhtUrhgan accepted # a GM
charvar Quest[3][91]Prog 0          # a GM: accepted back when 10062 granted the quest
trigger Faursel                     # Prog 0: 10064 (0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0): Desert Winds is current now
finish option=2                     # Prog 1
trigger Faursel                     # Prog 1: 10064
finish option=3                     # 1000 gil, under 500000: nothing (Prog 1)
trigger Faursel                     # Prog 1: 10064
finish option=0                     # no arm: nothing
